# Bolt Bend costs {3} less to cast if you control a creature with power 4 or greater: Bot1's Bloodthirsty Conqueror (5/5)
# makes it cost {R}, so tapping Mox Ruby alone pays for it (Mox Emerald stays untapped). Bot2's Lightning Bolt at the
# Conqueror is redirected; the Bolt can now go to Bot1 or Bot2 (not the Conqueror, its old target), so Bot1 is asked and
# picks Bot2. Bot2 loses 3 (17) and the Conqueror's trigger gains Bot1 3 (23); the Conqueror takes no damage.

